      "content": "It's weird because the content is basically the same. Do you think the lack of detail in the second abstract is because it's just written more simply, or do you think there's a difference in the actual quality of the research coming out of places like Lagos vs Oxford? Be honest, I'm trying to see if there's an underlying trend here.",
